{"matched":48,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0266c01","n":"0266c","t":"成唯識論述記卷第二本沙門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0267a01","n":"0267a","t":"共成除勝定果餘宗無故述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0267b01","n":"0267b","t":"皆是礙性三有對中障礙有對"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0267c01","n":"0267c","t":"如日輪舉照柱等時東處承光"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0268a01","n":"0268a","t":"方所有極微應相涉入合為一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0268b01","n":"0268b","t":"成第三別破外處不成述曰即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0268c01","n":"0268c","t":"種所造各別堅性等故是肉團"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0269a01","n":"0269a","t":"非是外處四大所造三解云五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0269b01","n":"0269b","t":"以現行種子二法為眼根等然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0269c01","n":"0269c","t":"謂色心等能為引生緣似自色"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0270a01","n":"0270a","t":"緣為不定過且望一色處作法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0270c01","n":"0270c","t":"此是識內不同他宗如緣命根"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0271a01","n":"0271a","t":"時極微應是五識所緣體即和"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0271b01","n":"0271b","t":"與五識為其所緣即極微相故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0271c01","n":"0271c","t":"微之心彼執所緣即極微故如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0272a01","n":"0272a","t":"無相仍有體相故經言一切諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0272b01","n":"0272b","t":"又如何說長等假色色處所收"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0272c01","n":"0272c","t":"是常故佛說極微令其除執而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0273a01","n":"0273a","t":"三五十四等說五十四說非肉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0273b01","n":"0273b","t":"身故或依止義為眾多法所依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0273c01","n":"0273c","t":"住乃至終盡位時名滅今言生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0274a01","n":"0274a","t":"菩薩地中四十六云滅若有因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0274b01","n":"0274b","t":"何能動風定非此非善惡故如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0274c01","n":"0274c","t":"字等所依由帶字等能詮表故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0275a01","n":"0275a","t":"文相易知言因心者簡脣口等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0275b01","n":"0275b","t":"具故種子增長增長福業故受"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0275c01","n":"0275c","t":"為體豈一現思亦表無表彼非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0276a01","n":"0276a","t":"別顯若爾何者名身語業述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0276b01","n":"0276b","t":"道道者依止義依之進趣生當"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0276c01","n":"0276c","t":"現可得故無不定失又擇滅等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0277a01","n":"0277a","t":"等所不攝故如瓶忿等顯揚十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0277b01","n":"0277b","t":"難也先皆總非次方申難此總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0277c01","n":"0277c","t":"法不即不離不可離現而說有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0278b01","n":"0278b","t":"無故又得於法為因能起或不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0278c01","n":"0278c","t":"由功用而現行者染法未為奢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0279a01","n":"0279a","t":"伏名成貪嗔等伏名不成已伏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0279b01","n":"0279b","t":"位名成其體亦有成不成無種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0279c01","n":"0279c","t":"生名非得故非得唯有屬於所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0280a01","n":"0280a","t":"初內外相同難此牒外救若無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0280b01","n":"0280b","t":"能所無差難若以於法起同言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0280c01","n":"0280c","t":"因於今事業起同事欲何要別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0281b01","n":"0281b","t":"故經言三法三法者何述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0281c01","n":"0281c","t":"五識不遍三界故恒續簡第六"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0282a01","n":"0282a","t":"根無所屬若取現識為根即定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0282b01","n":"0282b","t":"起若無別實法遮心等不生心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0282c01","n":"0282c","t":"來礙色心法即能厭唯應心種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0283a01","n":"0283a","t":"現行依此一期無心分位假立"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0283b01","n":"0283b","t":"本識同性故名生得此相傳解"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷002a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":130,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}